{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-103","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与截差无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"A straight line commensurable in length with an apotome is an apotome and the same in order.","book":10,"number":103,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.103","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.103/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":103,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","contentId":"euclid-10-103","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"476af6b9ad9c824ab430ff52c5236538a2118038fc0e9b0da3d2da4045def8c8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-103.statement","euclid-10-103.construction.1","euclid-10-103.proof.1","euclid-10-103.construction.2","euclid-10-103.proof.2","euclid-10-103.proof.3","euclid-10-103.proof.4","euclid-10-103.proof.5","euclid-10-103.proof.6","euclid-10-103.proof.7","euclid-10-103.proof.8","euclid-10-103.proof.9","euclid-10-103.proof.10","euclid-10-103.conclusion","euclid-10-103.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-103.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b46e84aac9391e91db32423539039396251f47d57977ed66de7810fb86d0127","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A straight line commensurable in length with an apotome is an apotome and the same in order."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"长度可公度线截差无理线段线是截差无理线段线,顺序相同。（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9be2c4cb5f1266065dfbfe9308f7a0f2768a693420ce8bbff8bb14db1955db84","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be an apotome, and let CD be commensurable in length with AB; I say that CD is also an apotome and the same in order with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为截差无理线段,让CD成为长度可公度,AB;我说,CD也是截差无理线段,AB也是一样。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b457fdfbb7c291e3cf0be7ad426979cd8e01944035416189ab51a2bd21bbcbb","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is an apotome, let BE be the annex to it; therefore AE, EB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB是截差无理线段,所以BE是附件;因此,AE,EB是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6cb7906cff242c62fb5a0b328b938821e5019f316d90419d6f0b0bd51e6cef4a","citations":["euclid-6-12","euclid-5-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that the ratio of BE to DF is the same as the ratio of AB to CD; [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)] therefore also, as one is to one, so are all to all; [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)] therefore also, as the whole AE is to the whole CF, so is AB to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不妨假设,BE对DF的比与AB对CD的比相同;因此,作为一个对一个的比,所有比也是一样;因此,整个AE对整个CF的比等于AB对CD的比 [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)] [[V. 12](/principles/euclid-5-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"78d90f333e29262cadc89679eb1f6a3070709d8ca05e7bfcdf962b164525d73b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is commensurable in length with CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB是长度可公度和CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e7d18d840465d592c61f0700250a0a0a96c7fa4b07344215bdf730642103a018","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AE is also commensurable with CF, and BE with DF. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE也是可公度,CF,BE和DF。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"858c63b2fed7a9b94d5765b235797987a9ba72cb572c25d445e4f3ae31b7375f","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And AE, EB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore CF, FD are also rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE,EB是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,CF,FD也是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"70c713035c17aabb89e3cec33fa56e5592bae29c1180fac8613ebb07fbf21c09","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, as AE is to CF, so is BE to DF, alternately therefore, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE对CF的比等于BE对DF的比,AE对EB的比等于CF对FD的比；AE 与 CF 之比等于 BE 与 DF 之比；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"628a0fdf759987466ad43c7679a74b1c26d2baa317a313bedc53d1862f4f05bd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on AE is greater than the square on EB either by the square on a straight line commensurable with AE or by the square on a straight line incommensurable with it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE的正方形比EB的正方形 高,或者正方形直线可公度直线AE直线不可公度直线不可公度直线正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12d52d226b98c2133ed8def1f72cd2ba5ddb68f1171b99f767ebb1883c65bc4d","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then the square on AE is greater than the square on EB by the square on a straight line commensurable with AE, the square on CF will also be greater than the square on FD by the square on a straight line commensurable with CF. [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果AE上的正方形比EB的正方形长,再乘可公度直线上正方形直线上AE直线上可公度,则CF直线上正方形则也比FD直线上正方形正方形高,再乘可公度直线上CF直线上可公度正方形直线上CF。 [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2aaa02d311b9f85747d1607f40d95ae65a63617017d16e95708ac7dae8027090","citations":["euclid-10-12","euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if AE is commensurable in length with the rational straight line set out, CF is so also, [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] if BE, then DF also, [id.] and, if neither of the straight lines AE, EB, then neither of the straight lines CF, FD. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果AE是有理线段是长度可公度,CF也是,如果BE,DF也是,如果DF,如果不是AE,EB,那么,如果不是CF,FD,那么不是CF。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2518ce501df3da1970f676760f002066b67caf8b50525fe753d041c2c2ae953f","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if the square on AE is greater than the square on EB by the square on a straight line incommensurable with AE, the square on CF will also be greater than the square on FD by the square on a straight line incommensurable with CF. [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果AE的正方形比EB的正方形高,不可公度比AE线比正方形比AE线,CF线比正方形比FD线比正方形比不可公度比CF线比正方形比正方形比CF线比不可公度比正方形还大。 [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"479dbd81cb470b5a693876bed27389b65951df7f040f1ed3c2abd1481aa99a4c","citations":["euclid-10-12","euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if AE is commensurable in length with the rational straight line set out, CF is so also, if BE, then DF also, [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] and, if neither of the straight lines AE, EB, then neither of the straight lines CF, FD. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果AE是有理线段的长度可公度,CF也是,如果BE,DF也是,如果AE,EB,那么,如果不是AE,EB,那么,CF也不是CF,FD。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ee4905726e2db89258afb735aaa4f638d20e13f9a176a627af7c97ea328aba6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CD is an apotome and the same in order with AB. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CD是截差无理线段,AB、Q、D也是同样。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-103.source","contentId":"euclid-10-103","revisionId":"euclid-10-103@raw-476af6b9ad9c824a","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c16616a4e12525c79f33d0be5727f1790ff9f954cd86d10d1bc311f57c1a5453","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.103/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.103\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-103:euclid-10-73:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-103","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-103.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-73","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.103","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.103/","sourceLabel":"X. 73"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-103:euclid-6-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-103","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-103.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.103","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.103/","sourceLabel":"VI. 12"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-103:euclid-5-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-103","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-103.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.103",